  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Kenya-  Food products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to sustainable, inclusive and safe local food value chains in Africa, in which producers, the majority being women, receive a fair value for their produce, work under legal and safe conditions, and have improved access and control over land and other productive resources, by advocating for new and stronger public regulatory frameworks, subsidy schemes and extension systems to support implementation of GAP, create markets for safe and local toxic free food, and developing and rolling out a new farmer-to-market model.</narrative>
  </description>
